  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Plemmuri, on Rhodos</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement that Strabo places south of Lindos on east coast of the island of Rhodes. Nineteenth century scholars localized it at the ruined monastery of \u1f09\u03b3\u03af\u03b1 \u0396\u03c9\u03bf\u03b4\u03cc\u03c7\u03bf\u03c2 \u03a0\u03b7\u03b3\u03ae in Plimmiri, a decision followed in BAtlas. An extant church of the Zodikos Pigi is located near the modern mole and dock.",
